  Discovery orla_wants_wool "Orla Pendle wants one twist of wool for cairn three, and wants nobody to know.".
  Discovery orla_story "Orla Pendle and her husband quarrelled at cairn three a year ago and each shouted. She shouted: then go. He died in Sowing.".
  Discovery two_voices "Ines says there are two voices for cairn three tonight, not one.".
  Discovery orla_held "Orla stayed at the cairn for the breath after her own voice.".
  Discovery jory_words "Jory Pendle's answer, which Orla walked away from: he would not leave the cairn if she asked, and she should mind the wet step.".
  Discovery wat_known "The thin man in the sea-coat is Wat Hallet, Amos Hallet's son, home after four years.".
  Discovery wat_hopes "Wat Hallet hopes his father has shouted for him, and will not be seen if he hasn't.".
  Discovery amos_denies "Amos Hallet says his son has been dead to him four years.".
  Discovery amos_list "Amos Hallet's Sending, every year: the farm's news, flat, ending that the east field wants a man and the cap is on the nail.".
  Discovery ines_word "Ines Larkin's voice, last year, from cairn forty: one word, Yes.".
  Discovery forty_asked "Cairn forty belongs to nobody, and Ines Larkin washes it.".
}
